{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1111218001:1":{"text":"주변에 아무도 없는데 왜 이런 것들이 쌓여있지?","source_cn":"周围一个人也没有，这些东西为什么堆在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AE7BF9EAB3E3A25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111218002:1":{"text":"걱정하지 마세요, 제가 이 지저분한 식물들을 태워버릴게요.","source_cn":"不要紧，让我来烧掉这些乱七八糟的植物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x357A7FC69E4D3640","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111218003:1":{"text":"잠깐만요! 제가 좀 볼게요.","source_cn":"等一下！我想仔细看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEEF1B655D0037AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111218004:1":{"text":"음... 역시 제가 잘못 본 게 아니었네요. 여기에 희귀 식물의 씨앗이 섞여 있어요. 점칠 때 쓸 수 있는 거니까, 잘 보관해 둬야겠어요.","source_cn":"嗯……我没看错，这里面居然夹杂着几种珍稀植物的种子，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AD55947A3368DC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111218005:1":{"text":"잠깐만요, 우선 전부 가져가서 꼼꼼히 골라야겠어요.","source_cn":"稍等，我把他们都带走，之后再慢慢筛捡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B4ED0D63FBED998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti